WEBVTT

00:00:04.199 --> 00:00:05.200
[MOANS]

00:00:05.375 --> 00:00:07.159
Back to bed.
要上床睡觉

00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:10.380
Ah, yes, we'll get to the bed.
We all love the bed.
对，我们要上床睡觉了，我们都喜欢床

00:00:10.554 --> 00:00:12.730
But we're just gonna
do one thing first.
不过还有件事得先做一下

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:18.605
Is it shorts
weather where we're going?
穿短裤去那不冷吧？

00:00:18.779 --> 00:00:21.129
Jeez. I hope not.
My body isn't
swimsuit-ready yet.
但愿冷点，在公共场合穿泳装
我还不太习惯

00:00:21.304 --> 00:00:23.480
Whatever. Where's Griffin?
无所谓，葛莱芬去哪了？

00:00:23.654 --> 00:00:25.786
Hey, can I have a second?
I'm just saying
goodbye to Emily.
能等我一分钟吗？我去和艾米丽道个别

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.614
Oh, brother.
这人

00:00:27.788 --> 00:00:30.182
GRIFFIN: [IN GIRLY VOICE]
I'm gonna miss you so much.
我会非常想你的

00:00:30.356 --> 00:00:31.966
GRIFFIN: [IN NORMAL VOICE]
You know,
you have to be strong, honey.
你得坚强点，宝贝
我们的爱情是坚不可摧的

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:33.011
Because what we
have is unbreakable.
你得坚强点，宝贝
我们的爱情是坚不可摧的

00:00:33.185 --> 00:00:34.229
[BOTH KISSING]
你得坚强点，宝贝
我们的爱情是坚不可摧的

00:00:34.404 --> 00:00:35.883
[SOBBING]
宝贝，别哭，大家都看着呢

00:00:36.057 --> 00:00:38.538
GRIFFIN: Babe, don't cry.
Everyone's looking.
宝贝，别哭，大家都看着呢

00:00:38.712 --> 00:00:40.235
Okay,
I gotta call him on this.
我去叫他停下来

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:43.326
Just let him play it out,
get it over with.
让他演完吧，好进行下个行动

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:47.765
Okay, you two lovebirds.
Drink your champagne
and let's get going.
好了，你们两只爱情鸟
喝完香槟，我们要上路了

00:00:47.939 --> 00:00:50.028
GRIFFIN: Oh, yeah.
No, sure. Okay.
好吧，行

00:00:50.202 --> 00:00:51.116
Cheers, babe.
干杯，宝贝

00:00:53.292 --> 00:00:55.512
Oh. You klutz.
你个笨笨

00:00:55.686 --> 00:00:57.644
We can't say
nothin' about this?
–我们不能奚落他两句？
–不行，没有那个时间

00:00:57.818 --> 00:00:59.124
No. We don't have
time for zingers.
–我们不能奚落他两句？
–不行，没有那个时间

00:01:07.698 --> 00:01:11.005
How do you click in
the stupid car seat?
这个愚蠢的座椅要怎么系？

00:01:11.179 --> 00:01:12.790
You gotta cut
those nails, man.
你该把指甲都剪了，兄弟

00:01:12.964 --> 00:01:14.574
We just strap our
kids down with duct tape.
我们用胶带绑自己的孩子

00:01:19.449 --> 00:01:21.538
What's he doing here?
我跟他说他能来，他从来没出过酒店

00:01:21.712 --> 00:01:23.844
I told him he could come.
He's never been
outside the hotel.
我跟他说他能来，他从来没出过酒店

00:01:24.018 --> 00:01:26.630
Blobby, there's no room.
Sorry, man.
斑点，车上没地了，对不起，朋友

00:01:26.804 --> 00:01:27.587
[MAKING NONSENSICAL SOUNDS]

00:01:29.415 --> 00:01:30.982
Yeah, that ain't happenin'.
那不可能

00:01:31.156 --> 00:01:33.767
Fine, put him on the Rascal.
Let's just get going.
行吧，让他坐代步车里
我们出发

00:01:39.382 --> 00:01:40.383
Oh.

00:01:48.739 --> 00:01:51.002
Where are we going,
Papa Drac?
我们去哪，德古拉姥爷？

00:01:51.176 --> 00:01:53.483
Oh, Denisovich, we're going
to have an adventure.
丹尼斯维奇，我们去冒险

00:01:53.657 --> 00:01:55.702
A monster-y adventure.
怪物大冒险

00:01:55.876 --> 00:01:58.662
Yay! Monsters!
We're gonna eat cake.
怪物！要吃蛋糕了

00:01:58.836 --> 00:02:00.751
What did he say?
–他说什么？
–本次怪物旅行没有蛋糕吃

00:02:00.925 --> 00:02:03.275
No.
No cake on this monster trip.
–他说什么？
–本次怪物旅行没有蛋糕吃

00:02:03.449 --> 00:02:06.887
No cake, cebause Kakie says,
"Too much cake
makes tummy ache."
没有蛋糕吃是“音位”卡蒂说
“蛋糕吃多了胃不舒服

00:02:07.235 --> 00:02:08.454
Yay!

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.021
"A monster always shares."
“真正的怪物总会和人分享”

00:02:11.718 --> 00:02:13.024
GRIFFIN: Wow!

00:02:13.198 --> 00:02:15.461
We may need
more than a week.
一个礼拜也许不够

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:18.725
Hey, you know who
could fix the kid
in a snap? Vlad.
你知道谁能让他短时间内
变得像个吸血鬼吗？弗拉德

00:02:18.899 --> 00:02:22.250
What?
We don't need to call Vlad.
We got this.
什么？不用找他，我们自己就能搞定

00:02:22.425 --> 00:02:26.864
You see, Denisovich,
monsters are nice,
just like you.
你看，丹尼斯维奇
怪物都很好，就像你一样

00:02:27.038 --> 00:02:31.085
But when the moon comes out,
the real monster fun begins.
可当月亮出来
怪物真正的乐趣才随之而来

00:02:31.259 --> 00:02:32.870
[MUSIC PLAYS ON RADIO]
很恐怖，对吗，各位？

00:02:33.044 --> 00:02:34.524
Being scary. Right, guys?
很恐怖，对吗，各位？

00:02:38.528 --> 00:02:39.616
Guys? Guys!
What is wrong with you?
各位？各位！你们没事吧？

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:41.661
[RADIO SWITCHES OFF]
各位？各位！你们没事吧？

00:02:41.835 --> 00:02:43.881
Come on.
Everybody likes that song.
来嘛，大家都喜欢那首曲子

00:02:44.055 --> 00:02:47.711
We're not everybody.
We're scary monsters.
Remember?
我们跟大家不一样
我们是恐怖的怪物，记得吗？

00:02:47.885 --> 00:02:48.973
GRIFFIN:
Hey, what are you putting in?
–你放的是什么？
–有声读物

00:02:49.147 --> 00:02:50.583
It's an audio book.
–你放的是什么？
–有声读物

00:02:50.757 --> 00:02:53.673
Bigfoot's life story.
He reads it himself.
大脚的真实故事，他亲自读的

00:02:53.847 --> 00:02:55.370
WOMAN: Chapter One.
第一章

00:02:55.545 --> 00:02:56.241
[MR. BIGFOOT GROWLING]

00:03:02.726 --> 00:03:03.553
[MUSIC PLAYING ON HEADPHONES]

00:03:04.205 --> 00:03:05.032
[SIGHS]

00:03:27.881 --> 00:03:28.839
Wow!

00:03:29.013 --> 00:03:31.102
This is gonna be so amazing.
这一定很赞

00:03:31.276 --> 00:03:34.105
Oh, yeah.
You're gonna be so happy,
but not too happy.
是啊，你会很开心的，可别开心过了头

00:03:34.279 --> 00:03:35.933
Huh? What?
–什么？
–你成长过程中的一切，我都要看

00:03:36.107 --> 00:03:37.978
I wanna see
everything you did
growing up.
–什么？
–你成长过程中的一切，我都要看

00:03:38.152 --> 00:03:40.285
As long as you're distracted,
capisce?
只要分散你的注意力，明白？

00:03:42.243 --> 00:03:43.680
We can hit a few spots
on the way to my parents.
去我爸妈家的路上
我带你去几个地方

00:03:43.854 --> 00:03:45.246
Lemme just quickly call home.
–我给家打个电话
–别打了

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:47.118
Ah! Don't do that.
–我给家打个电话
–别打了

00:03:47.292 --> 00:03:49.903
It's only 1:00 a.m. there.
Dennis isn't even up yet.
那边是凌晨一点，丹尼斯还没醒呢

00:03:50.077 --> 00:03:53.254
Right. I'm just not used to
being away from him.
没错，他不在身边，我还很不习惯

00:03:53.428 --> 00:03:55.692
Everything's gonna be cool.
Your dad was so all over it.
不会出事的，为了照顾丹尼斯
你爹盼了很久，也准备了很久

00:03:55.866 --> 00:03:57.868
I know. He's the best.
我知道，他是最棒的

00:04:18.628 --> 00:04:19.846
DRACULA: Right turn, here.
这里右转

00:04:20.891 --> 00:04:22.632
Denisovich, rise and shine.
丹尼斯维奇，月亮晒屁股咯

00:04:22.806 --> 00:04:24.198
[SNORING]
丹尼斯维奇，月亮晒屁股咯

00:04:24.372 --> 00:04:26.897
Boys, this bringing
back any memories?
朋友们，看到这片森林
有没有想起些什么？

00:04:27.071 --> 00:04:30.204
We used to prowl around here
when we were in our 100s.
我们一百多岁的时候，常常在这徘徊

00:04:30.378 --> 00:04:33.643
The Dark Forest of Slobozia.
这就是斯洛博齐亚黑森林

00:04:43.087 --> 00:04:44.610
Nice how they built it up.
–他们居然建了个公园
–好了，下车

00:04:44.784 --> 00:04:46.830
Okay, out of the car.
–他们居然建了个公园
–好了，下车

00:04:47.004 --> 00:04:49.484
Denisovich,
you're going to see
丹尼斯维奇
你将看到每个怪物最拿手的绝技

00:04:49.659 --> 00:04:52.052
every monster
do his specialty.
丹尼斯维奇
你将看到每个怪物最拿手的绝技

00:04:52.226 --> 00:04:55.708
First, Frank's gonna show us
how he scares people.
首先，弗兰克展示的是他吓唬人的本事

00:04:55.882 --> 00:04:58.581
Yay! He's gonna say, "Boo."
–他要说：“呜”
–我可不觉得说“呜”能吓人

00:04:58.755 --> 00:05:01.148
Yeah, I don't
think "boos" ever work.
–他要说：“呜”
–我可不觉得说“呜”能吓人

00:05:01.322 --> 00:05:04.282
But that's why we're here.
To learn from the master.
所以我们才来这，跟专家好好学学

00:05:05.544 --> 00:05:07.154
Okay, I'll give it a shot.
没问题，我来小试牛刀

00:05:17.512 --> 00:05:18.383
[INDISTINCT CHATTERING]

00:05:18.557 --> 00:05:19.297
[GROWLS]

00:05:23.257 --> 00:05:25.259
Yeah, guess it just depends
on work. [GASPS]
可能要看是什么工作

00:05:25.433 --> 00:05:26.870
[GROWLS]

00:05:27.044 --> 00:05:28.436
Frankenstein! [CHUCKLES]
弗兰肯斯坦！

00:05:28.611 --> 00:05:30.613
Hey, how ya doin'?
你们好啊？

00:05:30.787 --> 00:05:33.790
You're awesome!
Can we take a picture?
Is that okay?
太帅了！能合个影吗？可以吗？

00:05:33.964 --> 00:05:35.835
Sure, okay. Little
selfie action. [CHUCKLES]
没问题，来个小自拍

00:05:36.009 --> 00:05:37.054
[CAMERA CLICKING]

00:05:37.228 --> 00:05:37.924
For real?
没开玩笑吧？

00:05:38.882 --> 00:05:40.318
Awesome! Thank you so much.
–太帅了！谢谢你
–好好玩

00:05:40.492 --> 00:05:41.711
Hey, have a great day.
–太帅了！谢谢你
–好好玩

00:05:42.363 --> 00:05:43.974
Boo!
呜！

00:05:44.148 --> 00:05:46.063
Oh. He's adorable. He's adorable. [CHUCKLES]
–他好可爱
–他好可爱

00:05:46.237 --> 00:05:48.065
Adorable, yes.
可爱，没错啊

00:05:48.239 --> 00:05:51.068
Not scary,
but "boo" is a start.
虽然不吓人，可叫“呜”是个开始

00:05:51.634 --> 00:05:52.417
[SCREAMS]

00:05:53.418 --> 00:05:54.114
[NERVOUS CHUCKLE]

00:06:02.035 --> 00:06:04.647
My birthday cake's
gonna have
the coolest guy on it.
我的生日蛋糕上有个特别棒的人

00:06:04.821 --> 00:06:07.127
Let me guess. Kakie.
我猜猜，卡蒂

00:06:07.301 --> 00:06:10.957
No. He's so cool.
He climbs walls
and wears a cape.
不，他特别棒，能爬墙还穿斗篷

00:06:11.131 --> 00:06:13.960
Oh, really. And who
is this very cool guy?
真的啊，那这个很棒的人是谁呢？

00:06:14.134 --> 00:06:15.701
Batman!
–蝙蝠侠！
–蝙蝠侠，很好

00:06:15.875 --> 00:06:17.529
Batman. Great.
–蝙蝠侠！
–蝙蝠侠，很好

00:06:17.703 --> 00:06:20.750
You don't know anyone else
with a cape that's cool?
你就不认识别的穿斗篷很棒的人了

00:06:20.924 --> 00:06:22.012
This is good. Stop here.
这地不错，停这吧

